# No PDF is ever committed to this repository, under any licence.
# Audit rule S03 checks that the index holds none, because the difference between a corpus and a mirror is this line and one careless `git add -f`.
# A PDF here would also be a redistribution of somebody else's file, and arXiv's default licence grants arXiv the right to distribute and grants us nothing.
pdf/
*.pdf

# Built books. `ax book` writes LaTeX, a PDF and an EPUB, and the PDF and the EPUB are the paper itself in one file.
# Rule S03 fails on either of them in the index.
books/
*.epub

# Page rasters for the vision path. Large, derived, and regenerated by `ax render`.
images/

# The metadata plane's working copies: the Kaggle snapshot, the OAI-PMH pages and the S3 tarballs.
# The JSONL under metadata/ is committed, the several hundred gigabytes it was built from are not.
work/
downloads/

# Site output. Built by the toolchain and deployed from the build, never committed.
site/
dist/

.DS_Store
